"indent":1,"parameters":["在另一个无油无水的容器中，打发鸡蛋的蛋清，直到提起打蛋器能"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["拉出坚挺的小角。将三分之一的蛋白霜拌入巧克力面糊中搅匀，再"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["将全部面糊倒回剩余的蛋白霜里，从底部向上快速而轻柔地翻拌均"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["匀，以保留空气感。"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["将最终完成的面糊倒入模具，轻轻震出大气泡，然后送入预热好的"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["烤箱。待蛋糕体膨胀、表面呈现诱人的金黄色并散发出成熟香气时，"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["即可取出放凉。"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["在等待蛋糕冷却的同时，将草莓一部分对半切开，另一部分切成薄"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["片。"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["将完全冷却的蛋糕脱模，用奶油在顶部挤上洁白的花纹，然后将"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["草莓片和半颗草莓错落有致地装饰其上。"]},{"code":231,"indent":1,"parameters":[1,"蛋糕",0,0,192,40,100,100,255,0]},{"code":222,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["一个漂亮的草莓薄荷巧克力魔法蛋糕完成了！"]},{"code":235,"indent":1,"parameters":[1]},{"code":126,"indent":1,"parameters":[7,1,0,1]},{"code":126,"indent":1,"parameters":[8,1,0,1]},{"code":126,"indent":1,"parameters":[9,1,0,1]},{"code":126,"indent":1,"parameters":[10,1,0,1]},{"code":126,"indent":1,"parameters":[11,1,0,1]},{"code":126,"indent":1,"parameters":[12,1,0,1]},{"code":250,"indent":1,"parameters":[{"name":"Chime2","volume":90,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\C[31]获得成就：甜品大师"]},{"code":121,"indent":1,"parameters":[68,68,0]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"否"]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":404,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepA